    "1. Entropy and RCA diversity each explain about **16%** of ECI variation.\n",
    "2. Concentration (HHI) explains about **11%**.\n",
    "3. Quadratic models offer little improvement and perform slightly worse in leave-one-country-out checks.\n"
   ]
