   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "id": "next-steps",
   "source": [
    "## 6. Next steps\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Compare 2\u20133 country pairs with similar diversification but different ECI; plot their industry export shares and RCA specializations.\n",
    "2. Check whether the results hold with RCA cutoffs of 0.9 and 1.1 and different country samples.\n",
    "3. Investigate unusual rankings and data-quality issues before interpreting country results.\n",
    "4. Write a short memo summarizing the findings, country examples, and limitations.\n"
   ]
